---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StructuredDataAbout from '../components/StructuredDataAbout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Abderrahim GHAZALI"
  description="11+ years in software engineering. AI agent development, RAG systems, semantic search, n8n workflow automation, enterprise Drupal architecture, and full-stack development."
  keywords="AI agent development, RAG systems, semantic search, n8n automation, Drupal architecture, LangChain, full-stack developer, workflow automation"
  url="https://abderrahimghazali.github.io/about/"
>
  <Nav />

  <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div>
        <div class="index">§ / About</div>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 400;">
          About <em style="color: var(--fg-2); font-style: italic;">me.</em>
        </h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3rem;">
      <section>
        <p class="body-text">
          I'm Abderrahim, a software engineer based in Paris. Been doing this since 2014. Started with Drupal and PHP, picked up React and Node along the way, now mostly working on AI and automation.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          I split my time between building my own products and consulting. I like working across the stack, but what I enjoy most is taking some messy manual process and making it run on its own.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-top: 2rem;">
        <h2 class="section-label">What I've been up to</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          Launched <a href="https://www.mrrtracker.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-link">MRRTracker</a>, a macOS menubar app for tracking MRR. Hit #4 on Product Hunt. Built <a href="https://github.com/abderrahimghazali/mailfleet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-link">MailFleet</a>, a desktop email campaign tool with Tauri and Rust. Also shipped Sylius plugins, iOS apps, CLI tools, and a Claude Code plugin for Drupal.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          On the consulting side, I've worked on platforms with 500K+ monthly users, built search and RAG systems, and set up n8n workflows for clients in healthcare, publishing, and government.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-top: 2rem;">
        <h2 class="section-label">How I work</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          I'd rather spend an extra day on edge cases than fix things in production. Fine working solo or with a small team. I prefer direct communication over meetings about meetings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); padding-top: 2rem;">
        <h2 class="section-label">Stack</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, Rust, Swift, Python, PHP, Drupal, Symfony, Laravel, PostgreSQL, Docker, AWS, n8n, LangChain. Whatever fits.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section style="border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 2rem;">
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Open to consulting, contract work, and interesting collaborations.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;">
          <a href="https://cal.com/abderrahimghazali/15min?overlayCalendar=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">Book a call <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="mailto:ghazali.abderrahim1@gmail.com" class="btn">Email <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="https://github.com/abderrahimghazali" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">GitHub <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abderrahimghazali/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">LinkedIn <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
          <a href="https://www.drupal.org/u/gabderrahim" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn">Drupal.org <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>

    <a href="/" class="btn" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      ← Back to portfolio
    </a>
  </div>

  <StructuredDataAbout />
</Layout>

<style>
  .section-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-3);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    transition: border-color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .inline-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--fg);
  }
</style>
